)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
)BODY
%XMITMGR HELP -------------------------------- z/OS 3.2
%Command ===>_ZCMD                                            +
%
+XMIT Manager works on TSO TRANSMIT data sets. Those files
+are 80-byte card images. Segments inside the cards build
+INMR01, INMR02, INMR03, and INMR06 control records.
%
+Create runs TRANSMIT with OUTDATASET, so nothing is sent
+across the network. Extract runs RECEIVE with INDATASET.
+The replies RECEIVE expects are stacked by the dialog.
%
+View never calls RECEIVE. It decodes text units and, for a
+PDS, the IEBCOPY directory. Restore with Extract when you
+need the original data set rather than a listing.
%
+List line commands are V, E, T, H, and D. D issues DELETE
+after the confirm panel. FIND on the list locates a name.
%
+PF3 or END leaves the current panel.
)INIT
 .CURSOR = ZCMD
)END
